    "The Native and public pyz comparisons use pinned identical fixtures per case. Native repetitions are byte-identical within each case. All five new sidecar manifest/seal pairs validate.",
    "The two error cases remain explicitly documented differences in diagnostic channel/form. Matched finite cases remain distinct; no product code changed.",
    "Two independent parent audits found the stated finite target requirements satisfied after the direct ADDCHARA helper/copy/state sidecar was added."
  ],
  "not_claimed": [
    "Not every malformed argument, CSV number, or possible argument expression form.",
    "Nonzero pointer transitions/normalization and every CFLAG/CSTR/character array are not covered.",
    "No all-fields deep-copy claim; duplicate CSV10 isolation is limited to NAME, CFLAG1, and CSTR0.",
    "No failure-after-partial-add state, SP compatibility path, GUI rendering, or Native natural process exit.",
    "ADDSPCHARA case215 is not credited to ADDCHARA; its retained evidence belongs to ADDSPCHARA."
